wildos-overlays (0.1.3) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Passwords copied from a password manager or a Wild OS password box
    are wiped from the clipboard after 60 seconds, unless Clipboard
    forgets passwords is off in Advanced protection.
  * The panic key in Advanced protection can empty the clipboard history,
    its pinned items and the clipboard itself.

